\":\"WWE Break it Down\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3nNlO3wt8H8e6dju2rrUtHv3PUe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.14912280701754385,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":263089,\"title\":\"Mr. McMahon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mtLYsALvuHlnw7PHg0frCCwSRVy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.14796747967479673,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Season 3\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9SgztFv4sNB0Cj6Mr8MM0xYv92C.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2020-04-27\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":201,\"name\":\"A Message In The Sky\",\"overview\":\"Brandon announces the #KickOutChallenge. Luchasaurus continues his quest to find his tail. Matt & Nick see something ominous in the sky.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-27\",\"runtime\":18},{\"number\":202,\"name\":\"An Old Carny Trick\",\"overview\":\"Matt & Nick play a game of BTE. Brandon hosts another edition of the #KickOutChallenge. Hangman stays at home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/freddsgHlrGTHglgt226tz96cJU.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-05-04\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":203,\"name\":\"Living In The Woods\",\"overview\":\"Hangman moves to the woods. Matt thinks of a quick way out of a competitive jam. Who put the hit out on Private Party?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fgqpGJcMeB4KwHZ3o2xV7ZrCGSL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-05-11\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":204,\"name\":\"Monologue\",\"overview\":\"Hangman has a personal struggle. Matt finds a way out of doing house chores. Kenny has a long conversation with Colt.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dODTkOu20eECcaEGmGisp9NLzol.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-05-18\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":205,\"name\":\"Stadium Stampede\",\"overview\":\"The gang is back together for #DoubleorNothing. Matt & Nick surprise Matt Hardy with a service celebrating Vanguard 1. Go behind the scenes of #StadiumStampede.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mVErZUmS742LbrRnI91Hc3xkkb1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-05-25\",\"runtime\":35},{\"number\":206,\"name\":\"Gig\",\"overview\":\"The gang is back together for #AEWDynamite. Hangman meets Broken Matt Hardy. Best Friends are on the search for a new bit.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ldQ0ij3ExmAtYP43fen6Ldcy2OZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-01\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":207,\"name\":\"Colonoscopy\",\"overview\":\"Chris Daniels goes in for a colonoscopy. Matt Hardy teaches us what the insider term “Rib” means. Matt Jackson avoids a Zoom call.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Horo5qc12DNVb9IJyMn1CjGonQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-08\",\"runtime\":16},{\"number\":208,\"name\":\"Take It Home\",\"overview\":\"The crew film AEW Dynamite in Jacksonville, Florida. Matt Hardy teaches more inside terms using his Broken Brilliance. Hangman Page tries to pay back Private Party $12.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aNyHakRdXp6p8xfTlj5WnsTV479.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-15\",\"runtime\":15},{\"number\":209,\"name\":\"Christian AF\",\"overview\":\"Kenny warns Colt. Best Friends & Orange Cassidy struggle to write a proper BTE bit. Nick is dead ass.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aqnsFrABNp6Bmw2SfQlYVkEV2z5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-22\",\"runtime\":17},{\"number\":210,\"name\":\"Baby Back Ribs\",\"overview\":\"Hangman, Kenny, Matt & Nick go behind the scenes of their new action figure commercial. Brodie finds out he lost a big potential recruit. Brandon is put in a situation he’s not thrilled about.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cPldru6ekBbpRSqxSqfsnMU5QOX.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-29\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":211,\"name\":\"Have A Good Summer\",\"overview\":\"Matt & Nick visit with the cast members for individual updates. Merch Freak shows Broken Matt a magic trick. Hangman confronts Kenny about the emptied beer incident.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h2jl4xPw7ukN8NXS2CUyBhs7din.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-06\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":212,\"name\":\"This Episode is About 30 Minutes Long\",\"overview\":\"Matt kills the dreams of the guys when they’re offered a new Chili’s commercial. Frankie confronts Matt Hardy. Luchasaurus is afraid to hit a Canadian Destroyer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z2ywK16QzUNd98TNY6CxQm0dMLq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-13\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":213,\"name\":\"BC 4 Life\",\"overview\":\"Matt & Nick look back at an old memory from 2016. Kenny takes his anger out on Marko Stunt and apologizes. Brodie struggles to keep Dark Order in line.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5pDBNjt43vGV1PXNUkCRN5VOXyV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-20\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":214,\"name\":\"You Asking Us Out For A Beer?\",\"overview\":\"Frankie confronts Big Money Matt. Peter gets mad at Brandon for not cheating. Matt tries to appeal to the 50+ audience with oil pastel. Hangman befriends FTR.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dQh7WRGUHOy9i5tlbzxwEqHILaE.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-27\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":215,\"name\":\"A Birthday And A Death\",\"overview\":\"Nick gets stranded in Dallas on his birthday. Dark Order continue to have a difficult time recruiting. Best Friends decide to kill Brandon\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mgfWgYgNolLFTU4HHblhnQDnTYp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-03\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":216,\"name\":\"Malfunction\",\"overview\":\"Brandon is convinced he hallucinated a murder. Matt Hardy might not be the same after a brutal chair-shot. The gang get their Chili’s deal stolen from underneath them.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bcgKcJgbZah3tesltyqt7aiGScy.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-10\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":217,\"name\":\"Gold, Man\",\"overview\":\"Best Friends don’t want any witnesses. Matt & Nick wrestle Stu Grayson & Evil Uno on Dynamite. Brandon builds a PC for the 50+ audience.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a96BrPlafm1rBdyNTaef6v7Upps.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-17\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":218,\"name\":\"And New TNT Champion!\",\"overview\":\"Brodie celebrates winning the TNT Championship with Dark Order. Peter is tired of losing. Colt needs Dr. Sampson to fix his gold melted face.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dpmdabxx9pcNEdjcQZlOJvirn05.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-24\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":219,\"name\":\"You’re Out Of The Elite!\",\"overview\":\"Hangman is kicked out of The Elite. Brandon changes his oil.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/imqiQiRhwg2xSqdzyR66qCWY9lj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-31\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":220,\"name\":\"All Out Fall Out\",\"overview\":\"John & Alex continue to recruit. Hangman reaches out to Brandon. What is next for The Elite?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gpDnTK3zXzC0nWHKFNkw0Xo0HV7.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-07\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":221,\"name\":\"A Very Slippery Rope\",\"overview\":\"Matt & Nick just aren’t in the mood. Nakazawa makes a big impact at All Out. Dark Order has a dance off against TH2.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/joa8jm7EQh0pWwVqki1C36P6ciA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-14\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":222,\"name\":\"Sue\",\"overview\":\"Dark Order continue recruiting. Matt & Nick get another fine. Sue uses voodoo tricks on Santana & Ortiz.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Jc5ak4Wrti3IFq2GUK42cBjbJa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-21\",\"runtime\":14},{\"number\":223,\"name\":\"Sour Patch Kids\",\"overview\":\"Chris Daniels questions his future. Brandon almost gets murdered. Eddie cuts a promo on Sour Patch Kids.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jc0k9GToZjTqeMgKTb8OXSRImO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-28\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":224,\"name\":\"Just Kenny Omega\",\"overview\":\"Matt Sydal finally finds Nakazawa. Brandon introduces a new championship to BTE. Matt & Nick want to go back to the old days. Hangman is surprised by a tournament announcement.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nXgOcXF2o1TiST1iKWGuJg23YMf.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-05\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":225,\"name\":\"I Love You Dude\",\"overview\":\"The BTE Title is up for grabs in a 12 man, 3 Round, Gator Golf Tournament! Watch 3 first round games here. Brandon convinces Matt & Nick to extend one last olive branch to Hangman.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iKDLcbQQYASAsb3LsROYlKP0N2Y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-12\",\"runtime\":31},{\"number\":226,\"name\":\"Critical Failure\",\"overview\":\"Tony Khan hosts a press conference for Brandon Cutler vs Peter Avalon. Private Party throws an exclusive party. The BTE World Championship Gator Golf Tournament continues!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7TirfHCuJpAa1Gs7sf5gHjyDEl5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-19\",\"runtime\":34},{\"number\":227,\"name\":\"Dark Order Halloween Party\",\"overview\":\"Dark Order throws a Halloween party. Matt Jackson gets his ankle smashed by FTR. Round 2 of the BTE Championship Gator Golf Tournament takes place!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dXffMoJZ0HOIHtJBVnfIKWYuiaP.jpg\",\"rating\