,{\"number\":234,\"name\":\"Cowboy Day\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3mxdcVAFDo8GHr32YWVSQPuTgXe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-14\",\"runtime\":16},{\"number\":235,\"name\":\"A Christmas, Carol?\",\"overview\":\"Who is the new number 1 contender for the BTE title? Matt Hardy confesses why he’s been acting this way. Frankie Kazarian learns a new perspective. The Dark Order celebrate the holidays with their new friend.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AgyVEIHXJxJUne8ZaeLXKnKah2I.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-21\",\"runtime\":31},{\"number\":236,\"name\":\"Brodie\",\"overview\":\"We are saddened by the loss of BTE family member Brodie Lee. We love you Jon.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w1QoFjccO6ohLLpJRjyYc6RFyNs.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-28\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":237,\"name\":\"Tribute\",\"overview\":\"AEW comes together to celebrate the life of Brodie Lee AKA Jon Huber. Matt Hardy tries to make a deal with Private Party. Mustard Boy John Silver defends the BTE Championship against Marko Stunt.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hrhKxOJ0v3dStNwZwoGigYuSNQU.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-04\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":238,\"name\":\"The Band Is Back Together\",\"overview\":\"It’s an ELITE reunion when Gallows & Anderson show up on Dynamite. The guys have outgrown the EVP room & think it’s time for a move. Who will become #1 contender for Silver’s BTE Championship?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Ano1SsdLxRhjZIYov61XjvHfaI0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-11\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":239,\"name\":\"Duped\",\"overview\":\"Matt & Nick were duped, but by who? The Beaver Boys explode when Silver defends the BTE Championship against Reynolds!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mj6dlaepAdrhWvYjCOKABFbVzNF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCo